-- =========================================================================
-- Ecom typeclasses — `Storage` + `HasPreview`, authored as Fenel
-- record-of-methods class types (signature-substrate Phase 4-prep, D0b: the
-- ecom TS `Interface` literals AND the former `fenel/std/interfaces.fenel`
-- copies consolidate onto this module-local source — the
-- `fenel/modules/social/interfaces.fenel` precedent). The ecom seam
-- `seedFromType`s them (dispatch param = the declared head binder) and
-- system-entities registers the seeds — the same wiring as the retired
-- consts, now sourced from `.fenel`.
--
-- The arrows mirror the retired TS literals (the LIVE contracts):
--   Storage.store       blob Blob -> AssetRef        Storage.retrieve  ref AssetRef -> Blob
--   Storage.delete      ref AssetRef -> Unit         Storage.publicUrl ref AssetRef -> String
--   HasPreview.thumbnail value a -> size {width,height} -> Image
--   HasPreview.preview   value a -> Markup
-- Param names + class descriptions are display metadata the curried
-- spelling drops (the AI-port authorized-delta class; retired spellings
-- recorded above).
-- =========================================================================

-- File storage backend — content-addressable blob store
Storage backend = Storage store: (Blob -> AssetRef) retrieve: (AssetRef -> Blob) delete: (AssetRef -> Unit) publicUrl: (AssetRef -> String)

-- Types that can generate visual previews
HasPreview a = HasPreview thumbnail: (a -> { width: Number, height: Number } -> Image) preview: (a -> Markup)
